# Moddy Arena: a limited number of hotbar wishes in each wave. In prep he makes a Fire Sword with the Apprentice and puts
# it on his hotbar from its page. In the battle his own bar at the top says how many hotbar wishes he has left this
# wave (5 by default) and empties as he fires. The slot's sweep lasts the arena's 10-second rest, not the core's one
# second: a click while it sweeps makes nothing. When the five are used, a sixth fire is refused with one short line
# and the wish stays on his hotbar. When the wave is cleared the count starts again, and the next fire costs one of the
# new five. The control panel says the number a wave. No model anywhere: the Apprentice's local matcher offers the
# make, and the hotbar replays its recipe.
# The wave takes him into the arena (the gate shuts) and a resistance effect keeps him on his feet among the husks:
# the monsters are not what this tests, so the wave is ended by command once the count has been shown.
# play-timeout: 1200
@intent in a battle each hotbar fire costs one of the wave's wishes, shown on his own bar; its sweep lasts the arena's rest; out of wishes a fire is refused in one line and the wish stays; the count starts again at the next wave
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1200 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1200 0 true

@step the panel and /moddy wishes say the hotbar wishes a wave
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_means,nbt={text:{text:"Boss wave: 5\nHotbar wishes: 5 a wave"}}]
# the picture: the board straight ahead once the chat has faded
@aim pos 3.5 64.6 17.1
@wait 11s
@shot the-panel
moddy wishes
@expect chat /can be fired in a battle, 5 each wave/ within 5s

@step an Apprentice sword, on his hotbar from its page
moddy apprentice a fire sword
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@click item "Fire Sword"
@expect screen Fire Sword within 10s
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 4 within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s

@step he starts a battle, and his bar says 5 of 5
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 5 of 5 within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@aim look 180 10
@shot five-of-five

@step the first fire costs one, and clicks while its slot sweeps make nothing
# the rest starts at the click: 3 s and 7 s after it are past the core's one second and inside the arena's ten, so
# those clicks make nothing (the sword takes a few seconds to be made, so its line comes after them)
@key key.hotbar.4
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@wait 3s
@key key.use
@wait 1s
@shot still-sweeping
@wait 3s
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 5/ within 30s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 4 of 5 within 3s
@wait 3s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.4 *
@assert execute unless items entity @s hotbar.5 *
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 4 of 5 within 2s
@shot four-of-five

@step rested, it fires again, and again, until the wave's five are used
@wait 5s
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 6/ within 30s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 3 of 5 within 3s
@wait 11s
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 7/ within 30s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 2 of 5 within 3s
@wait 11s
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 8/ within 30s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 1 of 5 within 3s
@wait 11s
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 9/ within 30s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 0 of 5 within 3s
@wait 1s
@shot none-left

@step out of wishes: a fire is refused in one line, and the wish stays on his hotbar
@wait 11s
@assert execute if items entity @s weapon.mainhand minecraft:paper
@key key.use
@expect chat You have used your 5 hotbar wishes for this wave. You get 5 more when the next wave comes. within 5s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 0 of 5 within 2s
@shot out-of-wishes

@step the wave is cleared, and the count starts again
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
@expect chat Your 5 hotbar wishes for the next wave are ready. within 5s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 5 of 5 within 3s
@wait 1s
@shot five-again
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in/ within 30s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 4 of 5 within 3s
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 4 of 5 within 3s
@wait 1s
@shot the-next-wave
